  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-8 sm:pt-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Doc</p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">
        Attribute Registry
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
        What marketplace attributes are, why they exist on COCOCE, and the rules that keep the
        catalog consistent, trustworthy, and safe to build on.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-ink-400">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
